And, you know, the curve is,

00:29:00.090 --> 00:29:01.350
kind of, going up,

00:29:01.350 --> 00:29:02.970
but not that fast.

00:29:02.970 --> 00:29:07.800
And if you train it twice as long or even 10 times as long, will that help?

00:29:07.800 --> 00:29:09.060
Right? And again, training,

00:29:09.060 --> 00:29:10.905
training the algorithm for more iterations,

00:29:10.905 --> 00:29:13.260
it, you know, pretty much never hurts.

00:29:13.260 --> 00:29:15.240
