00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:17.235
training the algorithm longer, you know,

00:29:17.235 --> 00:29:19.380
almo- almost always helps, right?

00:29:19.380 --> 00:29:21.165
Pretty much never hurts, uh,

00:29:21.165 --> 00:29:26.250
